1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0574/3450/5404/files/untitled-design-1-661da9f383b8c.webp?v=1713220258" class="r-fe3f9h" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="19d3cf3a-1fa3-45ad-b7af-60ba031135ae" class="r-1j9w5xn"><div data-rid="b081ed9b-b3c3-44f0-8f46-3128fe3b00ed" class="r-uo8ift alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>FAQS</p></span></div><div data-rid="f9609995-f34d-490c-95c9-3b5494e87aba" class="r-llpfe3"><div data-rid="7bb5d5d1-08b1-41ba-b53a-a8be20ccd715" class="r-1xj544t"><div data-rid="00cddd44-784b-4c12-ace8-1a4b77795852" class="r-18tfn5p" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c52a02a9-71f1-4e88-a114-eb608aacb3ad" class="r-1hms77g" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f6a07e82-a422-4594-877b-54cbd7cd0427" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1vtnxgc"><div data-rid="a5472ca3-e363-48d6-97ab-4e163a435bd8" class="r-1ezl6x7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How quickly will I see results with Extreme Endurance?</p></span></div><div data-rid="832b27bc-9b4c-4a08-9daa-6dd6845c955f" class="r-7dtt4i"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="bc7c1592-5f82-4386-88f5-0e7ee605c637" class="r-3labdt"><div data-rid="7fa58efb-657a-44c2-b395-08221de55492" class="r-cqbkop alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Extreme Endurance will be in your system and working within 48-72 hours. We can confirm this from 12+ years of clinical testing.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2039ed17-a55c-4500-bbe0-90d5463cf3db" class="r-xseonj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b37b1314-963c-45ca-b830-9b0f509b62ff" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1elrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1t8v39f"><div data-rid="881180c8-d6cf-46d6-8c40-49133b0e3ac2" class="r-hg3x21 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take Extreme Endurance with other supplements?</p></span></div><div data-rid="90cee98f-886d-4774-800a-1575a4f75eb2" class="r-1hvmiwe"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1elrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R1elrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="47bc14bc-ebfa-40d0-9857-1a5e713fea79" class="r-bfow8s"><div data-rid="160effe3-d2bc-4ff2-84d8-ce22b6eaac82" class="r-rnjvo6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Extreme Endurance can be taken together with almost every other supplement but you do not need to take any product containing Beta Alanine when taking Extreme Endurance. <br>Please reach out to <a href="mailto:info@xendurance.com">info@xendurance.com</a> for specific inquiries.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2039468b-9344-4b1a-8efd-2a61b16ddbc5" class="r-1clo56c" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="96fa33b9-3217-4430-970d-2802beb1383d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1ulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-14ue6rz"><div data-rid="ef1a09ee-1bcb-4d80-82a9-ea69e7ab64a4" class="r-25dkuq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do I need to take Extreme Endurance with food?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e4995207-3d25-48dc-bd00-bde0caa40fed" class="r-3as9pf"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1ulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R1ulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="2171b19d-2369-4e78-94a0-5b249e931818" class="r-14yetmw"><div data-rid="4840d90a-eb5a-48c9-889a-829c50a10823" class="r-flcq3m alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You do not need to take Extreme Endurance with food.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a8530a5a-734e-46d7-a36a-30e48a95206a" class="r-141c5q9" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="dfbe2f6a-d4a7-4377-9be4-d5c31081ce21" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2elrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-d9v1d9"><div data-rid="1bce23c3-1e68-4ab2-835c-c0f86b9461e7" class="r-109pkbk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is Extreme Endurance certified drug free?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a1ce5f3b-3f84-407b-9d37-c7775ce83fc0" class="r-1tc35q4"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2elrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R2elrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="55865a7d-9700-4a4c-87c9-f9b812fdf9e0" class="r-38lcqe"><div data-rid="60b64dc7-d537-4a79-b181-713588fab7a3" class="r-1wk2tah alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Extreme Endurance was the very first US sports nutrition supplement certified drug free by LGC; Informed Sport.</p><p><br></p><p>LGC is a world-renowned sports doping control and research laboratory, with over 50 years of expertise in anti-doping in sport. LGC has published over 300 scientific papers on methods for the detection of trace levels of substances that are prohibited in sport and has over 450 man-years of research into doping control.</p><p>LGC has been testing supplements and ingredients on behalf of reputable manufacturers and suppliers for over 15&nbsp;years. It has tested tens of thousands of samples during this time and has also carried out a number of research studies to explore the prevalence of contamination with prohibited substances in products and ingredients.</p><p><br></p><p>LGC's research into supplements and contamination also includes several administration studies to investigate the levels of prohibited substances that could cause an athlete to fail a doping test. These have been published in peer-reviewed&nbsp;scientific journals. As a doping control laboratory, LGC works directly with sports authorities, national anti-doping organizations, and national governing bodies worldwide.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="651a06f2-156b-4bbe-86be-3a3df3562f09" class="r-1wck3th" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="aa660c2a-365f-4e66-bdce-7cd1836a391b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2ulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-14cjrmm"><div data-rid="19ded7c5-ccef-4460-b148-3bc48731f3c8" class="r-8ydfjx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is Extreme Endurance certified drug free by the NCAA?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dae9cdff-c8c3-46f4-a0bc-dba0acc9f597" class="r-onybyv"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2ulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R2ulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="331c8e7c-8634-49de-9fbe-1c308e9740a9" class="r-1czz0tn"><div data-rid="fa56dc10-9891-4616-97c9-d98c9acb1292" class="r-ynum1f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are no NCAA approved supplement products. The NCAA does not approve supplements.  Since 2007, Xendurance has had thousands of NCAA student-athletes take Xendurance products and rely on the Informed-Sport certification which is a global testing method for banned substances. To learn more please find the Informed-Sport&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://sport.wetestyoutrust.com/"><u>link</u></a>.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ec18cf13-35ca-422b-b9c4-360f3d3d82eb" class="r-1jut7pg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="10da4454-03e9-486e-948c-5295d8d054a9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3elrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1v1t05y"><div data-rid="807da713-ad64-41fa-a1e1-d9bf3e2afbe6" class="r-1njcobp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can Extreme Endurance be taken with caffeine?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c3829aab-1c7f-46e2-b011-b4fada672cc5" class="r-70m50o"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3elrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R3elrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="976a0c78-8b1c-4acd-a8dd-d3b726ec45a2" class="r-xv91w6"><div data-rid="429fcb6f-6b0a-4c6a-8bd3-ed67f625de3d" class="r-1nvtafq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Over the years we have found that some people have a very acidic diet and their diet may interfere with the dissolution of the product in the small intestine. On the other hand, one of our athletes drinks 12 cups of coffee per day and lives on Extreme Endurance with great results! Everyone is different but the few that have had issues cleared up the dissolution problem by limiting acidic drinks, red meat, and coffee when taking Extreme Endurance. <br><br>We now encourage people to take their caffeine within an hour prior to or after taking their tablets just as a precaution.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b05caa55-5724-4c6f-9c5e-8b205b6a6c87" class="r-ez6ln8" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7b42ce31-9528-4f02-85af-2f050438aad0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3ulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-776fyo"><div data-rid="08023a85-b39e-4c93-bf69-8a15c3bf0237" class="r-kq8263 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do I need to cycle off Extreme Endurance?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dae7f8b6-2243-4363-a69b-2608ba2981aa" class="r-lajhu"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3ulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R3ulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="81d3a754-3e68-410b-9461-f4905c68d00b" class="r-4vhaos"><div data-rid="62959263-3cd8-4162-b848-4c8a3cd2f774" class="r-bav0vd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You don’t cycle with Extreme Endurance. You take it consistently, like a multivitamin; for training, performance, heart-lung function, and for better body pH and alkalinity.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ebf4e1f3-7ec4-4551-8ef6-85c923271d21" class="r-1hsudnb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fda06a96-ab14-40d9-8076-f8be6eb7d101" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4elrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-edmtf0"><div data-rid="74664c45-cf4a-400e-b4d3-c81d6d8d909e" class="r-7fpe9p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can an athlete take Extreme Endurance if under the age of 18?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6874b3b2-af37-4c5c-81eb-24643b71e821" class="r-4ryocs"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4elrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R4elrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="0cd1fc47-1316-4e51-92e7-a69a415822d2" class="r-wl8pq4"><div data-rid="480e5785-9aa5-4c3e-aa06-7e11479fec6b" class="r-1qysfqs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We encourage a parent to email <a href="mailto:info@xendurance.com">info@xendurance.com</a> and provide the sport and activity level of their child and their age, and weight. We can then provide better guidance for the parent as to the experience we have seen with athletes using the product under the age of 18. We do not recommend anyone under the age of 14 use Extreme Endurance.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="347349cf-dd13-4c67-b68c-702721898385" class="r-1am9ytt" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3220d95f-69b3-4492-a3e3-7b5260e64a9a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4ulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-mmprig"><div data-rid="9879fbb2-fb22-49fb-b500-e11a68ddccb2" class="r-19ee3oj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When should you take Extreme Endurance? What time of day?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3fbad6cb-7c32-4f13-a5ee-b0c711fd53e3" class="r-uyhcqu"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" 